@startuml XrayGenerator_State
title X-ray Generator - State Machine

' Source of truth: XrayGenerator/src/main.cpp
' Role: I2C slave at I2C_ADDR_SLAVE_1.
'   onReceive(msgType, payload) updates lastResponse and dispatches via
'   handleMessage(); onRequest() returns {lastResponse, lastPayloadOutgoing}
'   then resets lastResponse to NAK.
'   PORTB bit 0 = pin 8 = X-ray emit; SAN_PIN = pin 2 = shoot trigger input.

[*] --> Idle

state Idle : entry / lastResponse = NAK\nwaits for I2C events
Idle : on MSG_HEARTBEAT  / lastPayloadOutgoing = 0x01, lastResponse = ACK
Idle : on MSG_DATA_READY / lastPayloadOutgoing = 0x01, lastResponse = ACK
Idle : on MSG_STOP       / lastPayloadOutgoing = 0x00, lastResponse = ACK
Idle : on MSG_ERROR      / (no-op, future)
Idle : on unknown msg    / lastResponse = NAK

' ---- Dispatch on MSG_START -------------------------------------------------
state "Exposing\n(MSG_START)" as Exposing {
  [*] --> ChoosePayload

  state ChoosePayload <<choice>>
  state ExposeNone            : PORTB &= ~0x01\n(idle the emit pin)
  state ExposeSingleShot      : SAN_PIN = INPUT\nuntil shotCount == 3:\n  on SAN==LOW: pulse PORTB 10 ms
  state ExposeSeries          : SAN_PIN = INPUT\nwait SAN -> LOW\nwhile SAN==LOW: toggle PORTB,\ndelay 10/490 ms
  state ExposeSeriesMotion    : SAN_PIN = INPUT\nuntil shotCount == 10:\n  on SAN==LOW: toggle PORTB,\n  delay 10/490 ms
  state ExposeFluoro          : SAN_PIN = INPUT\nwait SAN -> LOW\nuntil shotCount == 4\n  OR SAN==LOW:\n  toggle PORTB, delay 10/240 ms

  ChoosePayload --> ExposeNone         : [EXAM_TYPE_NONE]
  ChoosePayload --> ExposeSingleShot   : [EXAM_TYPE_SINGLE_SHOT]
  ChoosePayload --> ExposeSeries       : [EXAM_TYPE_SERIES]
  ChoosePayload --> ExposeSeriesMotion : [EXAM_TYPE_SERIES_WITH_MOTION]
  ChoosePayload --> ExposeFluoro       : [EXAM_TYPE_FLUORO]

  ExposeNone         --> [*]
  ExposeSingleShot   --> [*] : shotCount reached
  ExposeSeries       --> [*] : SAN released (HIGH)
  ExposeSeriesMotion --> [*] : shotCount reached
  ExposeFluoro       --> [*] : shotCount reached\nAND SAN released
}

Idle     --> Exposing : MSG_START\n/ lastResponse = ACK,\n  branch on lastPayloadIncoming
Exposing --> Idle     : run-to-completion\n/ SAN_PIN = OUTPUT

' ---- I2C response side (read path) ----
state ResponseRead : onRequest() writes\n{lastResponse, lastPayloadOutgoing}\nthen lastResponse = NAK

Idle     --> ResponseRead : onRequest()
Exposing --> ResponseRead : onRequest()\n(slave currently busy -> NAK)
ResponseRead --> Idle     : return

note right of Exposing
  Each exposure routine is implemented
  as a blocking loop inside
  handleMessage(MSG_START). While
  running, onRequest() returning NAK
  is what drives the master's retry
  loop in CentralAcquisition (see
  sendMessage() / "NAK, slave not
  ready yet").

  TODOs already marked in code:
  - timeouts on the SAN-wait loops
  - real sensor data instead of the
    hard-coded 0x01 outgoing payload
end note

@enduml
